WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:03.780
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:03.781 --> 00:00:06.079
What do they see?

3
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:10.448
They see a park.

4
00:00:10.449 --> 00:00:15.353
There are dinosaurs in the park!

5
00:00:15.354 --> 00:00:35.526
They see a Stegosaurus.

6
00:00:35.527 --> 00:00:50.137
They see a Triceratops.

7
00:00:50.138 --> 00:01:15.590
They see an Ankylosaurus.

8
00:01:15.591 --> 00:01:35.059
They see a Velociraptor.

9
00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:57.199
They see a Brachiosaurus.

10
00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:03.216
They see a Tyrannosaurus rex.

11
00:02:03.217 --> 00:02:12.147
Oops! The blobs press a button. Roar!

12
00:02:12.148 --> 00:02:16.272
Blobs, they are not real dinosaurs.

13
00:02:16.273 --> 00:02:24.813
They are statues.

14
00:02:24.814 --> 00:02:28.031
Silly blobs!

15
00:02:28.032 --> 00:02:32.923
Good-bye!

